   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 4. Unbiased pair and triple scan, 80-digit confirmation, and the one-site fits\n- **Pairs and triples.** All t_a(x)t_b(y) and t_a(x)t_b(y)t_c(z) with arguments in θ_s+ℤh are scanned (machine precision).\n- **Confirmation.** The local objects are recomputed at 80 digits with covector–Lax products. Exact surd arithmetic through T₍₄,₂₎ on 27×27 covectors would be slow.\n- **One-site fit.** The site vector is fitted as v = f·w + g·Ω_zw by least squares on all 27 components, where w is the same object on the one-site chain at θ_s.\n- **Closed form for f.** f is matched against ±∏(θ₁₂−kh)^{e_k}, k = 0..5, e_k ≤ 2, at 40 digits.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "pairScan[Λ_, s_] := Select[Flatten[Table[If[a == b && y < x, Nothing, With[{c = tApplyN[Λ, tApplyN[Λ, Ω2N[Λ], a, thN[[s]] + x hN], b, thN[[s]] + y hN]}, {a, x, b, y, locLabel[Λ, c]}]], {a, 2}, {x, cRange}, {b, a, 2}, {y, cRange}], 3], #[[5]] === labS[[s]] &];\ntripScan[Λ_, s_, rng_] := Module[{out = {}}, Do[If[(a < b || (a == b && x <= y)) && (b < c || (b == c && y <= z0)), With[{cv = tApplyN[Λ, tApplyN[Λ, tApplyN[Λ, Ω2N[Λ], a, thN[[s]] + x hN], b, thN[[s]] + y hN], c, thN[[s]] + z0 hN]}, If[locLabel[Λ, cv] === labS[[s]], AppendTo[out, {{a, x}, {b, y}, {c, z0}}]]]], {a, 2}, {b, 2}, {c, 2}, {x, rng}, {y, rng}, {z0, rng}]; out];\npairs420 = Table[pairScan[{4, 2, 0}, s][[All, 1 ;; 4]], {s, 2}];\ntrips420 = Table[tripScan[{4, 2, 0}, s, Range[-6, 6]], {s, 2}];\nchecks[\"[4,2,0] pure products: no local pair on either site; no triples\"] = pairs420 === {{}, {}} && trips420 === {{}, {}};\n(* 80-digit two-site covector ops (d x d matrices); exact surd arithmetic through T42 on 27x27 is too slow *)\npc = 80; Ωn = N[Ω1[{4, 2, 0}], pc];\nLaxX[Λ_, s_, v_] := LaxX[Λ, s, v] = Table[KroneckerDelta[a, b] (v - thN[[s]]) IdentityMatrix[dim[Λ]] + hN N[EH[Λ][a, b], pc], {a, 3}, {b, 3}];\ncTab[Λ_, C_, a_, l_, v_] := Sum[Transpose[LaxX[Λ, 1, v][[a, k]]] . C . LaxX[Λ, 2, v][[k, l]], {k, 3}];\ntApplyX[Λ_, C_, a_, v_] := Which[C === 0, 0, a == 0, C, a == 3, qdet[Λ][v] C, a < 0 || a > 3, 0, True,\n   Sum[Sum[Signature[σ] Fold[zN[[#2[[2]]]] cTab[Λ, #1, σ[[#2[[1]]]], #2[[2]], v - (#2[[1]] - 1) hN] &, C, Transpose[{Range[a], I}]], {σ, Permutations[I]}], {I, Subsets[Range[3], {a}]}]];\n(* one-site ops at site s (covector w, d-vector), same twist; a = 3 by its own quantum minor *)\nwApplyX[Λ_, s_, w_, a_, v_] := Which[w === 0, 0, a == 0, w, a < 0 || a > 3, 0, True,\n   Sum[Sum[Signature[σ] Fold[zN[[#2[[2]]]] (#1 . LaxX[Λ, s, v - (#2[[1]] - 1) hN][[σ[[#2[[1]]]], #2[[2]]]]) &, w, Transpose[{Range[a], I}]], {σ, Permutations[I]}], {I, Subsets[Range[3], {a}]}]];\ncbrGen[app_, c0_, λ_, u_] := Module[{lc = conj[λ], n = Max[λ], dp}, dp[0, {}] = c0;\n   dp[k_, S_] := dp[k, S] = Total[Table[With[{a = lc[[j]] + k - j}, If[a < 0 || a > 3, 0, (-1)^Count[S, x_ /; x > j] app[dp[k - 1, DeleteCases[S, j]], a, u + (k - 1) hN]]], {j, S}]]; dp[n, Range[n]]];\n(* an object = list of factors {\"T\", λ, c} or {\"t\", a, c}, evaluated at θ_s + c h *)\nobj2[Λ_, s_, fl_] := Fold[If[#2[[1]] === \"T\", cbrGen[tApplyX[Λ, #1, #2, #3] &, #1, #2[[2]], thN[[s]] + #2[[3]] hN], tApplyX[Λ, #1, #2[[2]], thN[[s]] + #2[[3]] hN]] &, Outer[Times, Ωn, Ωn], fl];\nobj1[Λ_, s_, fl_] := Fold[If[#2[[1]] === \"T\", cbrGen[wApplyX[Λ, s, #1, #2, #3] &, #1, #2[[2]], thN[[s]] + #2[[3]] hN], wApplyX[Λ, s, #1, #2[[2]], thN[[s]] + #2[[3]] hN]] &, Ωn, fl];\nlocResX[s_, C_] := Norm[Flatten[If[s == 1, C - Outer[Times, C . Ωn/(Ωn . Ωn), Ωn], C - Outer[Times, Ωn, Ωn . C/(Ωn . Ωn)]]]]/Norm[Flatten[C]];\n(* least-squares fit v = f w + g Ω on all components, with its relative residual *)\nfitFG[v_, w_] := With[{fg = LeastSquares[Transpose[{w, Ωn}], v]}, {fg[[1]], fg[[2]], Norm[v - fg . {w, Ωn}]/Norm[v]}];\n(* candidate closed forms for f: ± products of (θ12 - k h), k = 0..5, exponents ≤ 2, total degree ≤ 6 *)\nθ12 = thN[[1]] - thN[[2]];\nfGuess[f_] := Module[{facs = Table[θ12 - k hN, {k, 0, 5}], best = \"?\"}, Do[With[{p = Times @@ (facs^e)}, If[Abs[Abs[f/p] - 1] < 10^-40, best = Row[{If[f/p > 0, \"+\", \"-\"], Row[Table[If[e[[k + 1]] > 0, Superscript[Row[{\"(θ12-\", k, \"h)\"}], e[[k + 1]]], Nothing], {k, 0, 5}]]}]]], {e, Select[Tuples[Range[0, 2], 6], Total[#] <= 6 &]}]; best];\nobjs420 = {{1, {{\"T\", {1, 1}, -4}}}, {1, {{\"T\", {2, 2}, -4}}}, {1, {{\"T\", {3, 2}, -4}}}, {1, {{\"T\", {4, 2}, -4}}}, {1, {{\"T\", {2, 2}, -4}, {\"t\", 1, -2}}}, {1, {{\"T\", {4, 2}, -4}, {\"t\", 2, 1}}},\n   {2, {{\"t\", 2, 1}}}, {2, {{\"T\", {2, 2}, 0}}}, {2, {{\"T\", {2, 2}, 0}, {\"t\", 1, -2}}}};\n{exT, exRes} = AbsoluteTiming[Table[Module[{s = ob[[1]], fl = ob[[2]], C, v, w, fg},\n     C = obj2[{4, 2, 0}, s, fl]; w = obj1[{4, 2, 0}, s, fl];\n     v = If[s == 1, C . Ωn, Ωn . C]/(Ωn . Ωn);\n     fg = fitFG[v, w];\n     {s, fl, N[locResX[s, C], 3], N[fg[[1]], 10], N[fg[[2]], 10], N[fg[[3]], 3], fGuess[fg[[1]]]}], {ob, objs420}]];\nchecks[\"[4,2,0]: all 9 local objects confirmed at 80 digits (max locality resid)\"] = Max[exRes[[All, 3]]];\n(* product rows need not be of the form f w + g Ω (they were not at [3,1,0]/[3,2,0]); recorded, not asserted *)\nchecks[\"[4,2,0]: CBR site vectors (rows 1-4, 7, 8) = f (one-site object) + g Ωzw (max resid)\"] = Max[exRes[[{1, 2, 3, 4, 7, 8}, 6]]];\nGrid[Join[{{\"site\", \"factors\", \"locality resid\", \"f\", \"g\", \"fit resid\", \"f = ?\"}}, exRes, {{\"time (s)\", exT}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
