  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* reconstruction of every HW-limit eigenstate (<x0|Psi> = 1) at small twist, 20 w, 200 digits: data b = M.Psi stand in for the Q side (exact identity) *)\n{trc, rcR} = AbsoluteTiming[Table[{e, fam, reconP[e, ωMany[[1 ;; 20]], 200, fam]}, {e, {10^-6}}, {fam, {{\"site1\", \"site2\"}, {\"site1\", \"site2\", \"Ω\"}}}]];\nerrOf[r_, sel_] := Max[Select[r, sel][[All, {4, 5}]]];\nchecks[\"[4,2,0] site1+site2+Ω: all HW states except [5,4,3]x2, [4,4,4] reconstructed (max rel. err)\"] = errOf[rcR[[1, 2, 3]], ! MemberQ[{{5, 4, 3}, {4, 4, 4}}, #[[1]]] &];\nchecks[\"[4,2,0] site1+site2+Ω: [5,4,3] and [4,4,4] NOT reconstructed (min rel. err, not a zero test)\"] = Min[Select[rcR[[1, 2, 3]], MemberQ[{{5, 4, 3}, {4, 4, 4}}, #[[1]]] &][[All, 5]]];\nGrid[Join[{{\"ε\", \"data\", \"μ\", \"dim\", \"rank (+x0)\", \"rel. error Ψ\", \"rel. error HW part\"}},\n   Flatten[Table[Join[{r[[1]], StringRiffle[r[[2]], \"+\"]}, row], {r, Flatten[rcR, 1]}, {row, r[[3]]}], 1], {{\"time (s)\", trc}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
