   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 5b. The blind spot, and adding non-localized t-rows\n**(a) Blind spot.** For each failing sector, the cell takes the null space N(ε) of the localized data (site1+site2+Ω+x₀) and measures how much of HW_μ lies inside it. A singular value 1 means the data have **exactly zero overlap** with that HW vector at this ε. In that case no number of ε-orders and no choice of w can recover it.\n\n**(b) Non-localized rows.** Any polynomial in the t's applied to ⟨Ω| is Q-computable, since ⟨Ω|f(t)|Ψ_B⟩ = f(Λ_B)⟨Ω|Ψ_B⟩. The cell adds the rows ⟨Ω(w)|t_a(u) at two generic points, plus one product, and redoes the ranks and the reconstruction.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* (a) the blind spot: singular values of P_HW restricted to the null space of the localized data (site1+site2+Ω+x0, sector μ, 20 w, ε = 1e-6). Value 1 = HW_μ lies entirely in the null space *)\nnullHW[eps_, μ_] := Module[{sec = Flatten[Position[wtB, μ]], cf = covFamP[eps, ωMany[[1 ;; 20]], 200], x0 = x0S[eps, 200], M, sv, V, r, Nn, H},\n   M = Append[rows[cf, {\"site1\", \"site2\", \"Ω\"}, sec], x0[[sec]]];\n   {sv, V} = {Diagonal[#[[2]]], #[[3]]} &[SingularValueDecomposition[M]];\n   r = Count[sv, x_ /; x > 10^-60 First[sv]]; Nn = Transpose[V[[All, r + 1 ;;]]];\n   H = hwB[μ][[All, sec]];\n   {Length[Nn], N[SingularValueList[N[H, 200] . ConjugateTranspose[Nn], Tolerance -> 0], 3]}];\nnh = Table[{μ, nullHW[10^-6, μ]}, {μ, {{5, 4, 3}, {4, 4, 4}}}];\nchecks[\"[4,2,0]: HW_[5,4,3] and HW_[4,4,4] lie inside the null space of the localized data (min overlap, not a zero test)\"] = Min[Flatten[nh[[All, 2, 2]]]];\n(* (b) extra NON-localized rows <Ω(w)|t_a(u) at generic u: still Q-computable, <Ω|f(t)|Ψ_B> = f(Λ_B)<Ω|Ψ_B> *)\ngenOps = {{{\"t\", 1, 37/100}}, {{\"t\", 2, 37/100}}, {{\"t\", 1, -113/100}}, {{\"t\", 2, -113/100}}, {{\"t\", 1, 37/100}, {\"t\", 2, -113/100}}};\nfamGen[eps_, ωs_, pr_] := Module[{zE = N[Exp[eps φT], pr]}, Table[Module[{Ω = Om1P[pr, zE, N[Exp[eps ωv], pr]], C0}, C0 = Outer[Times, Ω, Ω];\n     <|\"loc\" -> Join[Flatten /@ (objP[pr, zE, C0, 1, #] & /@ site1Ops), Flatten /@ (objP[pr, zE, C0, 2, #] & /@ site2Ops), {Flatten[C0]}], \"gen\" -> (Flatten /@ (objP[pr, zE, C0, 1, #] & /@ genOps))|>], {ωv, ωs}]];\nrg = Module[{cf = famGen[1/3, ωMany[[1 ;; 20]], 80], x0 = x0S[1/3, 80]}, Table[With[{sec = Flatten[Position[wtB, μ]]}, {μ, Length[sec], rankTol[Append[rows[cf, {\"loc\"}, sec], x0[[sec]]], 10^-40], rankTol[Append[rows[cf, {\"loc\", \"gen\"}, sec], x0[[sec]]], 10^-40]}], {μ, {{4, 4, 4}, {5, 4, 3}, {5, 5, 2}, {6, 3, 3}}}]];\nchecks[\"[4,2,0]: + generic t rows: full rank in (4,4,4), (5,4,3), (5,5,2), (6,3,3)\"] = AllTrue[rg, #[[4]] == #[[2]] &];\nrcg = Module[{sts = psiStatesP[10^-6, 200], cf = famGen[10^-6, ωMany[[1 ;; 20]], 200], x0 = x0S[10^-6, 200]},\n   Table[With[{μ = st[\"mu\"], sec = Flatten[Position[wtB, st[\"mu\"]]]}, Module[{M, ψt, ψr, hb},\n       M = Append[rows[cf, {\"loc\", \"gen\"}, sec], x0[[sec]]]; ψt = st[\"ψ\"][[sec]]; ψr = LeastSquares[M, M . ψt]; hb = hwB[μ][[All, sec]];\n       {μ, N[Norm[hb . ψr - hb . ψt]/Norm[hb . ψt], 3]}]], {st, sts}]];\nchecks[\"[4,2,0]: + generic t rows: all 19 HW states reconstructed (max rel. err, ε = 1e-6)\"] = Max[rcg[[All, 2]]];\nGrid[Join[{{\"(a) μ\", \"dim null space\", \"overlap sv of HW_μ with null space\", \"\"}}, {#[[1]], #[[2, 1]], #[[2, 2]], \"\"} & /@ nh,\n   {{\"(b) μ\", \"dim\", \"rank: localized + Ω\", \"rank: + generic t rows\"}}, rg,\n   {{\"reconstruction with + generic rows\", \"# states\", Length[rcg], ScientificForm[Max[rcg[[All, 2]]], 3]}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"758597\" data-output-id=\"326\" data-out-n=\"453\" data-sub-idx=\"11\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"14\" data-sub-start=\"20\" data-sub-end=\"22\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[453]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:10.84em;vertical-align:-5.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-7.65em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:10.8em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-5.15em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.65em;\"><span style=\"top:-7.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">(a) </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1