   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Result.** All coefficients are fitted at one numeric point; see `L2-420-localization.md`.\n\n**Site 1, all at θ₁−4h.**\n- **What localizes:** T₍₁,₁₎, T₍₂,₂₎, T₍₃,₂₎ and T₍₄,₂₎.\n- **Factors:**\n  - f₍₁,₁₎ = (θ₁₂−2h)(θ₁₂−5h);\n  - f₍₂,₂₎ = (θ₁₂−h)(θ₁₂−2h)(θ₁₂−4h)(θ₁₂−5h);\n  - f₍₃,₂₎ = (θ₁₂−h)(θ₁₂−2h)²(θ₁₂−4h)(θ₁₂−5h);\n  - f₍₄,₂₎ = (θ₁₂−h)²(θ₁₂−2h)²(θ₁₂−4h)(θ₁₂−5h).\n- **Span:** rank 5.\n\n**Site 2.**\n- **What localizes:** t₂(θ₂+h) with the same f as T₍₁,₁₎; T₍₂,₂₎(θ₂) with the same f as T₍₂,₂₎; and T₍₂,₂₎(θ₂)·t₁(θ₂−2h).\n- **Span:** rank 4.\n- **No pure pairs or triples** are local.\n\n**Reconstruction with site1 + site2 + Ω + x₀** (ε = 10⁻⁶).\n- **16 of 19 HW states exact,** including all three [6,4,2] copies.\n- **[4,4,4] and both [5,4,3] copies are invisible.** HW_μ lies entirely in the null space of the localized data (overlap singular values exactly 1), so no number of ε-orders or w (or φ) helps.\n- **Adding non-localized rows** ⟨Ω(w)|t_a(u)| at generic u (still Q-computable) makes every sector full rank, and **all 19 HW states come out exact**.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Summary of checks\nBoolean checks must be `True`. Numeric residuals must be below 10⁻²⁵; the machine-precision ones from Section 1 must be below 10⁻¹¹. Entries marked \"not a zero test\" are sizes, and must be large.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "passQ[k_, v_] := Which[v === True, True, v === False, False, StringContainsQ[k, \"not a zero test\"], v > 10^-3, StringContainsQ[k, \"O(ε) expected\"], v < 10^-6, StringContainsQ[k, \"machine\"], v < 10^-11, NumericQ[v], v < 10^-25, True, False];\nGrid[Prepend[KeyValueMap[{#1, If[NumericQ[#2], ScientificForm[N[#2, 3], 3], #2], If[passQ[#1, #2], Style[\"PASS\", Darker[Green]], Style[\"FAIL\", Red]]} &, checks], {\"check\", \"value\", \"\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
